{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sendBadges:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@NSInteger","text":"NSInteger","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"badge","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"badge","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The current application badge number (0 to clear badge)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports the current badge count to Pushwoosh for analytics and to enable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"badge-based segmentation. This is useful for:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Analytics"}]},{"text":": Track user engagement through unread counts","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Segmentation"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Target users with high\/low badge counts","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Badge management"}]},{"text":": Allow server-side badge manipulation","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Call this method whenever you update the app badge to keep Pushwoosh in sync.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Example","level":2,"anchor":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Sync badge with Pushwoosh when updating unread counts:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["class NotificationBadgeManager {","","    private(set) var unreadCount: Int = 0 {","        didSet {","            updateBadge()","        }","    }","","    func markAsRead(_ notificationIds: [String]) {","        unreadCount = max(0, unreadCount - notificationIds.count)","    }","","    func handleNewNotification() {","        unreadCount += 1","    }","","    func clearAll() {","        unreadCount = 0","    }","","    private func updateBadge() {","        \/\/ Update system badge","        if #available(iOS 16.0, *) {","            UNUserNotificationCenter.current().setBadgeCount(unreadCount)","        } else {","            UIApplication.shared.applicationIconBadgeNumber = unreadCount","        }","","        \/\/ Sync with Pushwoosh","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(unreadCount)","    }","}","","\/\/ Usage in AppDelegate","class AppDelegate: UIApplicationDelegate {","","    func applicationDidBecomeActive(_ application: UIApplication) {","        \/\/ Sync current badge state when app becomes active","        let currentBadge = application.applicationIconBadgeNumber","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(currentBadge)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sendBadges:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"sendBadges:","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","title":"sendBadges:","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)sendBadges:"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/sendbadges:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/sendBadges:"},"abstract":[{"text":"Synchronizes the application badge number with Pushwoosh servers.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"type":"topic","title":"PushwooshCore","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"role":"symbol","title":"PWConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","type":"topic"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/sendBadges:":{"abstract":[{"text":"Synchronizes the application badge number with Pushwoosh servers.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/sendbadges:","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/sendBadges:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sendBadges:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"sendBadges:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"sendBadges:","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"}}}